# Review routing for the fleet.
#
# Tenant requests are written here by Port's self-service action, never by hand.
# The review IS the approval: a namespace cannot exist until someone named below
# merges the diff that asks for it.
#
# The split matters. Infrastructure reviews individual REQUESTS — is this team
# entitled to this capacity on this cluster. The platform team owns the STANDARD
# itself, because a change under charts/ silently re-provisions every existing
# tenant on the next sync.

/tenants/     @Kubernis/global-infra
/charts/      @Kubernis/platform-team
/clusters/    @Kubernis/platform-team
